n15: rather than a normal folder.\\n16: \\n17: Notable changes:\\n18: \\n19: - **Mirror the new API contract.** Add `is_system` / `is_hidden` to the\\n20:   `NoteCategory` type and the `PATCH /notes/categories/{id}/hidden` endpoint to\\n21:   `apiRoutes.notes`, so the client can identify the journal folder by its system\\n22:   flag and toggle hidden.\\n23: - **Journal navigation entry.** Add a **Journal** destination to the notebook\\n24:   navigation (desktop sidebar and mobile notebook drawer), beside Favorites. It\\n25:   opens the journal interface and is never an expandable folder of notes.\\n26: - **Journal interface.** Provide **Today**, **Yesterday** and **Other**\\n27:   (datepicker into the archive). Opening a day resolves that day's entry by the\\n28:   title convention (`YYYY-MM-DD` via `getUrlFormat`) inside the journal folder,\\n29:   creating it on first open, and hands it to the existing note editor. No note\\n30:   list — days, not names.\\n31: - **Day reach.** From the notebook, only today and earlier are reachable; future\\n32:   days are not selectable. The archive datepicker marks...\n  Line 13: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791638140331,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0bb1edffevhUCDBo4PLP4dz\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_01_rEezf5c6o37CeOEvvMOS2445\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"is_hidden|is_system|NoteCategory\",\"include\":\"*.ts\"},\"output\":\"Found 16 matches\\n/workspace/tests/unit/stores/Notes.test.ts:\\n  Line 4: import type { Note, NoteCategory } from '$lib/types/note';\\n\\n  Line 50: function category(id: number, title: string, overrides: Partial<NoteCategory> = {}): NoteCategory {\\n\\n\\n/workspace/src/lib/state/Notes.svelte.ts:\\n  Line 2: \\tCreateNoteCategoryRequest,\\n\\n  Line 5: \\tNoteCategory,\\n\\n  Line 6: \\tUpdateNoteCategoryRequest,\\n\\n  Line 30: \\tcategories = $state<NoteCategory[]>([]);\\n\\n  Line 42: \\tdragTarget = $state<NoteCategory | null>(null);\\n\\n  Line 88: \\t\\tif (res) this.categories = res.data as NoteCategory[];\\n\\n  Line 240: \\tasync createCategory(edit: boolean = false): Promise<NoteCategory | null> {\\n\\n  Line 248: \\t\\t\\tconst request: UpdateNoteCategoryRequest = { title: this.inputValue };\\n\\n  Line 255: \\t\\t\\tconst request: CreateNoteCategoryRequest =\\n\\n  Line 280: \\t\\treturn typeof res === 'object' ? (res.data as NoteCategory) : null;\\n\\n\\n/workspace/src/lib/types/note.ts:\\n  Line 28: export interface NoteCategory {\\n\\n  Line 35: \\tchildren: NoteCategory[];\\n\\n  Line 38: export interface CreateNoteCategoryRequest {\\n\\n  Line 43: export interface UpdateNoteCategoryRequest {\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"matches\":16,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"is_hidden|is_system|NoteCategory\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791638140250,\"end\":1791638140302}},\"id\":\"prt_125f4746b001ioxf3WmnVrtpc7\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0bb1edffevhUCDBo4PLP4dz\",\"messageID\":\"msg_125f46cb90017rZebd2c5wjZnF\"}}\n\n  Line 91: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791638199214,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0bb1edffevhUCDBo4PLP4dz\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_00_5UCfc3eSkkL1latv2AJJ1154\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/tasks.md\",\"content\":\"# Tasks: notebook journal\\n\\nid: exist\\nanalyst: analyst\\ndate: 2026-10-10\\n\\n<!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nBuild the notebook Journal surface on top of the API contract the brief\\ndescribes: mirror the type/route contract, extract the pure day/entry\\nresolution into a tested service, teach the Notes store about the system\\njournal folder (and exclude it from ordinary notebook surfaces), add the\\nJournal navigation entry, and build the day-based journal interface with an\\narchive datepicker. i18n across all four locales and unit tests are part of\\nthe work.\\n\\nBranch check: brief declares `branch: feature/exist_notebook-journal`. The\\nworktree is mounted on the job branch (this session has no shell to run\\n`git branch --show-current`, so the check could not be repeated independently;\\nthe workspace is a job worktree, which is on the job branch by construction).\\n\\n## Task breakdown\\n\\nTASK-1: Mirror the new API contract — add the `is_system`/`is_hidden` flags to\\nthe `NoteCategory` type and wire the `PATCH /notes/categories/{id}/hidden`\\nendpoint into `apiRoutes.notes`.\\nfiles: src/lib/types/note.ts, src/lib/config/apiRoutes.ts\\ndepends: none\\nrisk: low — additive type fields plus one route constant, no behavior change.\\n\\nTASK-2: Extract the pure day/entry-resolution logic into a new\\n`JournalService` (locate the journal folder by `is_system`, build the\\n`YYYY-MM-DD` entry title via `getUrlFormat`, find an existing entry among\\nnotes, compute which days already have entries for archive marking), and cover\\nit with unit tests following the existing `src/lib/services/` + tests pattern.\\nfiles: src/lib/services/JournalService.ts (new),\\n       tests/unit/...\n  Line 97: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1791638205552,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0bb1edffevhUCDBo4PLP4dz\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_125f56dfd001OuXcc17hZ00skq\",\"messageID\":\"msg_125f5667e00139u6OKf6xnFpeu\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0bb1edffevhUCDBo4PLP4dz\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wrote the task list to `/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/tasks.md`.\\n\\n**Branch check:** `brief.md` declares `branch: feature/exist_notebook-journal`. This session has no shell (no `git branch --show-current`) and `/workspace/.git` is unreadable from the mounted workspace, so I could not independently re-verify the branch — I proceeded on the system guarantee that the mounted workspace is the job's own worktree, which is on the job branch by construction.\\n\\n**Task breakdown (7 tasks):**\\n\\n| ID | Task | Risk |\\n|----|------|------|\\n| TASK-1 | Mirror API contract: `is_system`/`is_hidden` on `NoteCategory` + hidden-toggle route | low |\\n| TASK-2 | New tested `JournalService` with pure day/entry-resolution logic | medium |\\n| TASK-3 | Notes store: resolve journal folder, exclude it from ordinary surfaces, open/create day entry | high |\\n| TASK-4 | Journal i18n keys in the type + all four locale tables | low |\\n| TASK-5 | Journal nav entry in desktop sidebar + mobile drawer | medium |\\n| TASK-6 | Journal interface: Today/Yesterday/Other, archive datepicker, editor handoff | high |\\n| TASK-7 | Verification (`check`, `lint`, `test`) | low |\\n\\nKey sequencing: TASK-1 → TASK-2; TASK-3 depends on both; TASK-5 and TASK-6 depend on TASK-3 + TASK-4.\\n\\n**Two things I did not guess at** (recorded as open questions in `tasks.md`, not as speculative tasks):\\n1. The brief wires the hidden-toggle endpoint but describes no journal UI that uses it — I only scoped the wiring (TASK-1), no toggle UI.\\n2. The pinned `@svelte-plugins/datepicker` capability to mark/disable days can't be verified from this worktree (`node_modules` absent) — flagged under TASK-6.\\n\\nNeither is a blocker for implementation, so I did not halt; the developer/r...\n  Line 107: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791638217421,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0a7d94ffePtOp5YHUfGtuLZ\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_iErfFbMbPMaaYBMnAtVH5485\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/brief.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/brief.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Brief: notebook journal\\n2: \\n3: type: feature\\n4: id: exist\\n5: branch: feature/exist_notebook-journal\\n6: date: 2026-10-10\\n7: author: Leander Muskalla\\n8: \\n9: ## What\\n10: \\n11: Build the Journal surface in the notebook so the daily-journal mechanic the API\\n12: now supports is usable in the app. The API provisions one hidden, system-owned\\n13: folder per user (`title = '.journal'`, `is_system = true`, `is_hidden = true`,\\n14: root-level); the notebook must present it as a special day-based interface\\n15: rather than a normal folder.\\n16: \\n17: Notable changes:\\n18: \\n19: - **Mirror the new API contract.** Add `is_system` / `is_hidden` to the\\n20:   `NoteCategory` type and the `PATCH /notes/categories/{id}/hidden` endpoint to\\n21:   `apiRoutes.notes`, so the client can identify the journal folder by its system\\n22:   flag and toggle hidden.\\n23: - **Journal navigation entry.** Add a **Journal** destination to the notebook\\n24:   navigation (desktop sidebar and mobile notebook drawer), beside Favorites. It\\n25:   opens the journal interface and is never an expandable folder of notes.\\n26: - **Journal interface.** Provide **Today**, **Yesterday** and **Other**\\n27:   (datepicker into the archive). Opening a day resolves that day's entry by the\\n28:   title convention (`YYYY-MM-DD` via `getUrlFormat`) inside the journal folder,\\n29:   creating it on first open, and hands it to the existing note editor. No note\\n30:   list — days, not names.\\n31: - **Day reach.** From the notebook, only today and earlier are reachable; future\\n32:   days are not selectable. The archive datepicker marks...\n  Line 108: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791638217422,\"sessionID\":\"ses_eda0a7d94ffePtOp5YHUfGtuLZ\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_01_1BmoMXzyTb0j8LoWtLEj0411\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/tasks.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Tasks: notebook journal\\n2: \\n3: id: exist\\n4: analyst: analyst\\n5: date: 2026-10-10\\n6: \\n7: <!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n8: \\n9: ## Summary\\n10: \\n11: Build the notebook Journal surface on top of the API contract the brief\\n12: describes: mirror the type/route contract, extract the pure day/entry\\n13: resolution into a tested service, teach the Notes store about the system\\n14: journal folder (and exclude it from ordinary notebook surfaces), add the\\n15: Journal navigation entry, and build the day-based journal interface with an\\n16: archive datepicker. i18n across all four locales and unit tests are part of\\n17: the work.\\n18: \\n19: Branch check: brief declares `branch: feature/exist_notebook-journal`. The\\n20: worktree is mounted on the job branch (this session has no shell to run\\n21: `git branch --show-current`, so the check could not be repeated independently;\\n22: the workspace is a job worktree, which is on the job branch by construction).\\n23: \\n24: ## Task breakdown\\n25: \\n26: TASK-1: Mirror the new API contract — add the `is_system`/`is_hidden` flags to\\n27: the `NoteCategory` type and wire the `PATCH /notes/categories/{id}/hidden`\\n28: endpoint into `apiRoutes.notes`.\\n29: files: src/lib/types/note.ts, src/lib/config/apiRoutes.ts\\n30: depends: none\\n31: risk: low — additive type fields plus one route constant, no behavior change.\\n32: \\n33: TASK-2: Extract the pure day/entry-resolution logic into a new\\n34: `JournalService` (locate the journal folder by `is_system`, build the\\n35: `YYYY-MM-DD` entry title via `getUrlFormat`, find an existing entry among\\n3...","metadata":{"matches":13,"truncated":false},"title":"is_system|is_hidden","time":{"start":1791638234347,"end":1791638234429}},"id":"prt_125f5e4a50019SAe8guzl5nUi8","sessionID":"ses_eda0a7d94ffePtOp5YHUfGtuLZ","messageID":"msg_125f5db34001uPuMAHXA2YP7xe"}}
