{"type":"text","timestamp":1791639333030,"sessionID":"ses_eda0a7d94ffePtOp5YHUfGtuLZ","part":{"id":"prt_12606a0ca001PtLDDM3gwf3m6f","messageID":"msg_1260697c7001X1ou56fl7fO7kD","sessionID":"ses_eda0a7d94ffePtOp5YHUfGtuLZ","type":"text","text":"All seven tasks are implemented and committed on `feature/exist_notebook-journal` (branch matches `brief.md`), with a clean worktree.\n\n## Summary\n\nBuilt the notebook Journal surface from the brief:\n\n- **Contract (TASK-1)** — `NoteCategory` gained `is_system`/`is_hidden`; `apiRoutes.notes.updateCategoryHidden` (`PATCH …/hidden`) wired.\n- **Pure logic (TASK-2)** — new `JournalService` (folder resolution by `is_system`, `YYYY-MM-DD` titles, entry lookup, entry-date listing, day-granularity reachability) + 17 unit tests.\n- **Store (TASK-3)** — `Notes` resolves the system folder separately, keeps it out of the category tree, and excludes journal entries from newest/last-updated/favorites/no-category; added `openJournalEntry` (resolve-or-create → `activeNote`). +8 store tests.\n- **i18n (TASK-4)** — `journal`, `today`, `yesterday`, `other`, `journal_empty`, `journal_create_error` in the type + en/de/es/fr.\n- **Navigation (TASK-5)** — `urls.journal`, plus a Journal destination beside Favorites in the desktop sidebar and mobile drawer (plain link, never an expandable folder).\n- **Interface (TASK-6)** — `/notes/journal` with Today/Yesterday/Other, a month-grid archive picker (marks days with entries, disables future days, can't pass the current month), and the existing `TipTapEditor` (optional `autofocus` for Today).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run check`: **0 errors / 0 warnings**\n- `npm run build`: **succeeds** (journal route emitted)\n- `npm test`: **748 pass** (+25 new); 1 failure is pre-existing (`logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget`)\n- `npm run lint`: fails on the branch **before** this change (252 prettier / 292 eslint issues repo-wide); all added lines are clean.\n\n## Notable decision\n\nThe pinned `@svelte-plugins/datepicker` cannot mark days-with-entries (only enable/disable), so — using the escape hatch the analyst documented (\"a small extension or an alternative\") — the archive picker is a small custom month grid built on the repo's existing `getCalendarMonth` helper. `DatePicker.svelte` was left untouched. Full details are in `docs/jobs/exist_notebook-journal/implementation.md`.","time":{"start":1791639331018,"end":1791639333025}}}
